  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れさまです。今、戻りました\r\nふぅ……さて、報告書をまとめないと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030120020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "se": "0102",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110010,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "コートを、\r\nお預かりいたします……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、来てたのか凛世。ありがとう\r\nでもそんなこと、気にしなくていいんだぞ？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世が、こうしたいのです……\r\n今、お茶を、お持ちいたします",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そんなこと頼めないよ……\r\nでも、気持ちはありがとうな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それは……\r\n実家からの、便りでございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ、そうか……\r\nどんなことが書いてあったんだ？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\n凛世のアイドル活動を認める、と……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ちょうど、お伝えしたいと\r\n思っておりました……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、アイドル活動を……？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……杜野家では、凛世の活動を\r\n良く思っては、おりませんでした……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "アイドルになりたいと申したときは、\r\nそれはもう、大騒ぎで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうだったのか……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "ですが……\r\nどうしても……知りたかったのです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまが、\r\n凛世を、どこに連れて行ってくださるのか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "家族には……少し心配を\r\nかけてしまいましたが……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世……\r\n……そんな事情があったんだな……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\nしかし、後悔などしておりません",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまは、\r\n凛世を……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "最高の舞台に、連れていってくださいましたから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110140,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "あの日、プロデューサーさまと、出会ったのは\r\n運命でございます……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺もそう思うよ\r\nでも、凛世をここまで来させたのは、凛世の力だ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110150,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "貴方さまがいらっしゃればこそ、です……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110160,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "感謝いたします、プロデューサーさま\r\n家族も、そう申しております……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、どういたしまして……\r\n……っていうか……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "家族も、って……\r\n手紙に俺のことも？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110170,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……家には、貴方さまのことばかり\r\n書き送って、しまうのです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110180,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それで……\r\n貴方さまにお会いしてみたい、と……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110190,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "よろしければ……\r\n凛世の家族に、お会いいただけませんか",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まあ、凛世のご家族には\r\n一度きちんとご挨拶に伺った方がいいのかもな……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110200,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……！\r\nよろしいの、でしょうか……",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　ああ、そうだな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110210,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……それでは……\r\n報告の準備を、いたしましょう……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（『W.I.N.G.』の優勝報告……だよな……\r\nライブ映像とかを持っていくのかな？）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、俺も何か挨拶の言葉、\r\n考えておくよ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110220,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……！\r\n凛世は……幸せでございます……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "う、うん。ならいいんだけど……\r\nでも、準備って何をするんだ？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110230,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "そのようなこと、お尋ねにならずとも……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110240,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま……\r\nふつつかものですが、末永く、お願い申し上げます",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……\r\nこれからもよろしくな、凛世",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003110250,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\n夢のようで、ございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200511/2012003110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（何か話が食い違ってる気がするけど……\r\nまあ……大丈夫、か？）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]